# Security Review and Database Migration Planning

Sat, Nov 7, 2026, 2:55 AM · 0:30 · 0 AI uses

## Summary

The security review is complete and the final report is ready. The team of 12 engineers can start the database migration on Monday, pending receipt of the signed contract by Friday. The delivery date for the mobile app is still to be determined.

## Action items

- [ ] Send the signed contract to the legal team by Friday (Me)
- [ ] Provide the delivery date for the mobile app (Me)

